        } else {
            /* Proxy values: raw IR ~ 1000-2000 typically maps to ~60-100 bpm,
             * raw RED ~ 10000-20000 typically maps to ~90-100 % SpO2.
             * Real implementation must run the Si1172 proprietary HR/SpO2
