 * Board:  Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+
 * Sensor: Keyes KY-026 flame sensor (digital out, active-low)
 * Buzzer: Active buzzer (control line, active-high)
 *
 * Wiring:
 *   KY-026 D0  -> GPIO17 (physical pin 11)
 *   Buzzer +   -> GPIO18 (physical pin 12)
 *   Buzzer -   -> GND
 *
 * Build:  gcc -Wall -Wextra -O2 -o flame_alert flame_alert.c -lgpiod
